<<person1>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"제-제안을 받아들일게요." 당신은 말한다. "내-내기 말이에요."
	<br><br>
	"마음이 바뀌었구나." 렌이 미소 지으며 말한다. "난 좋아. 그럼, 할까?"

<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Alright... I'll accept," you say. "The betting too."
	<br><br>
	"Good," Wren says. "Glad you came around. Wanna play?"

<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "special">>
	"마음 바꿨어, 나도 돈 좀 거는 거 괜찮아." 당신은 말한다. "오해는 마, 넌 그 돈 구경도 못 할 테니까."
	<br><br>
	렌이 킥킥 웃는다. "자신만만하네, 안 그래? 네 말이 맞는지 돈으로 증명해 봐." 렌이 말한다. "할 거야?"

<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I changed my mind," you say. "The offer works for me. Let's play."
	<br><br>
	"Now that's the spirit," Wren says.

<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Fine. I'll accept," you say. "Let's stop circling and get on with it."
