:: Estate Cards Run
<<effects>>
<!-- estate ends 7 and 8 -->
<<if $wren_intro isnot undefined>>
	<<set $estate_cards_end to "run">>
<</if>>
<<if $estate.cards.state is "ride">>
	<!-- note - this is an impossible if clause. the player isn't given this option in the ride state. -->
	<<if $estate.cards.position is "pc_lap" or $estate.cards.position is "penile">>
		당신은 렌을 무릎에서 밀쳐내고 문으로 달려간다.
	<<else>>
		당신은 렌에게서 내려와, <<he>>【이가】 당신을 잡기 전에 문으로 달려간다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	당신은 돌아서서 달린다.
<</if>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	발소리가 뒤쫓아오지만, 당신은 오두막 바깥으로 달려나가 <span class="green">그들을 따돌린다.</span> 당신은 도랑으로 뛰어들어 숨는다.
	<br><br>

	<!-- estate end 7. currently still leads to the pot getting confiscated, we should add an extra option to try and run WITH the winnings for a higher chance of getting caught -->
	<<card_pot_confiscated>>
	<<estate_cards_finish>>

	<<link [[다음|Estate]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You hear footsteps pursue. You've barely made it outside when Wren <span class="red">tackles you to the ground.</span> "What should we do with <<phim "Wren">>?" <<he>> asks as more arms hold you down.
	<br><br>

	<<outfitChecks>>
	<<if _fullyNaked>>
		"The moor will take <<phim stranger>>," the <<person2>><<person>> replies.
	<<else>>
		<<clothesruined>><<exposure>>
		"물어볼 필요나 있나." <<person2>><<person>>【이가】 대답한다. 사방에서 손들이 당신의 옷을 움켜쥐고 천을 잡아당기고 찢어, 당신은 결국 발가벗겨진다. <<covered>>
	<</if>>
	<<fameexhibitionism 12>>
	<br><br>

	그들은 당신을 들어 올려, 알몸인 채로 사유지를 가로질러 입구로 향한다. 경비원은 당신이 오는 것을 보고, <<he>>【이가】 문을 열면서 비웃는다.
	<br><br>

	그들이 당신을 문밖으로 내던진다. 당신이 일어서는 동안 문이 덜컹거리며 닫히는 소리가 들린다. 당신은 조롱을 견디며 비틀거리며 멀어진다.
	<br><br>

	<!-- estate end 8. -->
	<<card_pot_confiscated>>
	<<estate_cards_finish>>

	<<link [[다음|Moor]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<estate_end>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Estate Cards Cheating Run
<<effects>>
당신은 돌아서서 달린다.
<!-- estate ends 5 and 6 -->
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<<if $wren_intro isnot undefined>>
		<<set $estate_cards_end to "cheat_run">>
	<</if>>

	발소리가 뒤쫓아오지만, 당신은 오두막 바깥으로 달려나가 <span class="green">그들을 따돌린다.</span> 당신은 도랑으로 뛰어들어 숨는다.
	<br><br>

	<!-- estate end 5 -->
	<!-- currently leads to the pot getting confiscated, perhaps we should have an alternative option for a higher risk escape (for a chance to grab your winnings) -->

	<<card_pot_confiscated>>
	<<estate_cards_finish>>

	<<link [[다음|Estate]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	발소리가 뒤쫓아온다. 당신이 간신히 밖으로 나왔을 때 렌이 <span class="red">당신을 땅으로 덮친다.</span>
	<br><br>
	"잡았다." 렌이 당신 위에 올라탄 채 말한다. "자, 이제 저항하지 마. 넌 좋은 손에 들어갈 거야 - <<nnpc_he "Remy">>【이가】 널 제대로 길들여 줄 테니."
	<<if activeInsanityTrait()>>
		<br><br>
		Pinned beneath Wren, you start laughing so hard that <<nnpc_he "Wren">> has to shift <<nnpc_his "Wren">> weight to keep you down.
		<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
			Your laughter comes muffled through your $worn.face.name. <span class="lustful">"Mmhfff...hAhAhAHA!!!"</span>
		<<else>>
			<span class="lustful">"HaHAHahAhAHA!!!</span>
			<<speechresolve>>
			<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
				<<case "polite" "docile">>
					Is that meant to reassure me or frighten me?!"
				<<case "bratty">>
					You always lie on people to tell them your terrible jokes?!"
				<<case "flamboyant">>
					A personal escort and a promise of trouble! You spoil me!!"
				<<case "cruel">>
					You need Remy to finish what you started?!"
				<<default>>
					You think that will scare me?!"
			<</switch>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"What's so funny?" Wren asks. <<nnpc_He "Wren">> looks down at you, waiting, but you only laugh harder. "Right. Save some of that for Remy." <<nnpc_He "Wren">> braces <<nnpc_himself "Wren">> over you again.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<!-- estate end 6. <<estate_end>> and <<endevent>> called within -->

	<<blackjackCaughtCheatingSurrender>>
<</if>>

:: Estate Cards Cheating Plead
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<!-- <<if $estate.cards.state is "ride">> is omitted because in that state the apologise option isn't given -->


<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"속여서 미안해, 제발 용서해 줘!" 당신은 애원한다.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm sorry, I know I shouldn't have done it," you say quickly. "Please don't be too hard on me."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I was caught, alright," you say. "I'm sorry. Could we please leave it at that?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "special")>>
	"젠장, 들켰네." 당신은 말한다. "그냥 없던 일로 해주면 안 될까?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Alright, you caught me," you say. "Call it even and let me walk."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Fine. You caught me," you say. "Happy now?"
<<else>>
	"들켰네." 당신은 말한다. "미안."
<</if>>

<<set _plead_points to $estate._base_plead_points + random($estate._plead_rng_min, $estate._plead_rng_max)>>
<<set _plead_success to (_plead_points gte $estate._plead_required_points)>>

<<if not $estate.prev_apologised and _plead_success>>
	<<if $wren_intro isnot undefined>>
		<<set $estate_cards_end to "cheat_moor">>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	렌이 한숨을 내쉰다. "너를 대체 어떻게 해야 할까?" 그가 말한다.<br><br>
	<span class="green">당신의 애원이 그에게 닿은 듯하다.</span>
	<br><br>
	"이 녀석을 <<nnpc_him "Remy">>에게 넘길 순 없어, 그러면 너무 골치 아파질 테니까," 렌이 말한다.
	<br>
	"What should we do with <<phim "Wren">>?" <<he>> asks <<his>> friends, who have completely surrounded you.
	<br><br>
	<<outfitChecks>>
	<<if _fullyNaked>>
		"Let's take <<phim stranger>> to the moor," the <<person2>><<person>> replies.
	<<else>>
		<<clothesruined>><<exposure>>
		"말할 필요도 없지." <<person2>><<person>>【이가】 대답한다. 손들이 사방에서 당신의옷을 움켜쥐고 잡아당기고 찢어발겨, 결국 당신은 알몸이 되고 만다. <<covered>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	그들은 당신을 들어 올려 알몸인 채로 저택을 가로질러 입구로 데려간다. 경비원이 다가오는 당신을 보고 비웃으며 문을 연다.
	<br><br>

	그들이 당신을 밖으로 던진다. 일어서는 동안 문이 덜커덩 닫히는 소리가 들린다. 야유를 견뎌내며 비틀거리며 멀어진다.
	<br><br>

	<!-- estate end 3 -->
	<<card_pot_confiscated>>
	<<estate_cards_finish>>

	<<link [[다음|Moor]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<estate_end>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $estate.prev_apologised>>
		<br><br>
		렌이 잠시 어이없다는 듯 당신을 쳐다보더니 코웃음 친다.
		<br><br>
		"너 정말 뻔뻔하구나, 그거 알아?" 그가 말한다. <span class="red">"지난번에도 똑같이 말했잖아."</span>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">"미안하다는 말로는 안 돼, <<lass>>,"</span> 렌이 말한다. "이번에 확실히 버릇을 고쳐놔야겠어."
	<</if>>

	<br><br>
	"Now, be a <<goodgirl>> and don't try anything stupid," <<he>> says with a smile.

	<br><br>
	<<blackjackCaughtControls 2>>
<</if>>

:: Estate Cards Cheating Protest
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"T-this is a misunderstanding, please!" you plead.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please, there has to be some mistake," you say quickly.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "special")>>
	"아, 정말, 이건 말도 안 돼!" 당신은 외친다. "너도 사기꾼이잖아. 증거도 없으면서!"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"You're jumping to conclusions," you say. "You don't have proof."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Cute accusation," you say. "Shame you can't prove it."
<<else>>
	"무슨 말인지 전혀 모르겠어요." 당신은 말한다. "실수하시는 거예요."
<</if>>

<br><br>
당신의 말은 귓등으로도 듣지 않는다. "네가 뭘 했는지 우리 둘 다 알잖아." 렌이 말한다. "네가 교훈을 얻도록 확실히 해야겠어."
<br><br>

"Now, be a <<goodgirl>> and don't try anything stupid," <<he>> says with a smile.
